(4390514, 630468, 19982, '<td valign="top">I bet this would be a beautiful photo ... even without over processing it.  To me, it''s just too "unreal".  The greens are over saturated, the water and grass are both over sharpened.  The sky and clouds are too dark.  (hint: generally any kind of reflection will be darker than the original, especially reflection off of a water surface, because some of the light is lost - but in this image, the reflection is brighter than the sky)    <br/> <br/>Turn the processing down just a bit and it''ll do fine.</td>', 'I bet this would be a beautiful photo ... even without over processing it.  To me, it''s just too "unreal".  The greens are over saturated, the water and grass are both over sharpened.  The sky and clouds are too dark.  (hint: generally any kind of reflection will be darker than the original, especially reflection off of a water surface, because some of the light is lost - but in this image, the reflection is brighter than the sky)     Turn the processing down just a bit and it''ll do fine.', '2008-01-14 01:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4390515, 632200, 19982, '<td valign="top">What little bit of color is in this image ... is over saturated, specifically the reds at the bottom center and the green on the middle right.  Colors like that just aren''t natural.</td>', 'What little bit of color is in this image ... is over saturated, specifically the reds at the bottom center and the green on the middle right.  Colors like that just aren''t natural.', '2008-01-14 01:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4390516, 632646, 19982, '<td valign="top">Poor Achoo....</td>', 'Poor Achoo....', '2008-01-14 01:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4390518, 632183, 19982, '<td valign="top">Turn the sharpening down and it will improve the feel of the image.</td>', 'Turn the sharpening down and it will improve the feel of the image.', '2008-01-14 01:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4390520, 631945, 19982, '<td valign="top">This would be more interesting if the water cut a diagonal across the image rather than a straight line right up the middle.  Even better would be some kind of S curve.</td>', 'This would be more interesting if the water cut a diagonal across the image rather than a straight line right up the middle.  Even better would be some kind of S curve.', '2008-01-14 01:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
