(4390703, 632408, 67258, '<td valign="top">A very pleasing study - the stillness is almost palpable.  my only very slight criticism is that I might have preferred the posts a little further to the right.</td>', 'A very pleasing study - the stillness is almost palpable.  my only very slight criticism is that I might have preferred the posts a little further to the right.', '2008-01-14 06:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4390704, 630096, 67258, '<td valign="top">A super idea for the photo, and a perfect title.  This is how I remember streams and rivers from my childhood - a playground, and this is very nicely observed.</td>', 'A super idea for the photo, and a perfect title.  This is how I remember streams and rivers from my childhood - a playground, and this is very nicely observed.', '2008-01-14 06:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4390706, 632832, 67258, '<td valign="top">You succesfully  portray a magical other-worldly feel here.  just the right amount of blur in the water to suggest the power.</td>', 'You succesfully  portray a magical other-worldly feel here.  just the right amount of blur in the water to suggest the power.', '2008-01-14 06:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4390714, 632855, 51538, '<td valign="top">Your photo reminds me of my usual Sunday morning walk, across Waterlow Park, down that street of faux Tudor houses, across Parliament Hill, and down to the lock for a beer and something or other.  That was back in the early 80s... so the view has changed somewhat.  It used to be much more gritty then.  Life was.  Thanks for the memories.  Photo is not so bad either.</td>', 'Your photo reminds me of my usual Sunday morning walk, across Waterlow Park, down that street of faux Tudor houses, across Parliament Hill, and down to the lock for a beer and something or other.  That was back in the early 80s... so the view has changed somewhat.  It used to be much more gritty then.  Life was.  Thanks for the memories.  Photo is not so bad either.', '2008-01-14 06:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4390716, 631890, 51538, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  The bird is a nice touch.</td>', 'Very pretty.  The bird is a nice touch.', '2008-01-14 06:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
