(4391025, 631254, 88336, '<td valign="top">Despite it being foggy, much of the picture seems out of focus.  Nice effect, though -- definitely someplace to experiment some more.</td>', 'Despite it being foggy, much of the picture seems out of focus.  Nice effect, though -- definitely someplace to experiment some more.', '2008-01-14 10:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
