(4391047, 632891, 35994, '<td valign="top">Colors seem a little flat IMO, I would''ve liked to see a little more contrast.</td>', 'Colors seem a little flat IMO, I would''ve liked to see a little more contrast.', '2008-01-14 10:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
