(4391202, 632716, 85563, '<td valign="top">It really looks like the subject in this photo is the grass and rocks in the foreground.  The rest really looks out of focus and like it is just an amazing background and doesn''t show how much time you really put into making sure the waterfall was perfect.</td>', 'It really looks like the subject in this photo is the grass and rocks in the foreground.  The rest really looks out of focus and like it is just an amazing background and doesn''t show how much time you really put into making sure the waterfall was perfect.', '2008-01-14 12:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
