(4391213, 632461, 85563, '<td valign="top">This really needed a quicker shutter. The bird is moving fast, but the water would be splashing slow and still give you the time lapse you were looking for.  Combined with the shakiness of your hand it just made the entire shot out of focus.  I love what you were trying to do, but it just didn''t work.</td>', 'This really needed a quicker shutter. The bird is moving fast, but the water would be splashing slow and still give you the time lapse you were looking for.  Combined with the shakiness of your hand it just made the entire shot out of focus.  I love what you were trying to do, but it just didn''t work.', '2008-01-14 12:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
