(4391266, 632658, 88010, '<td valign="top">The eye roams here and never really settles on anything. The water flow grabs the eye, but then it''s drawn back across to the person, then down to the rock, then....too much here. Golden rule of photography ( and I opften forget it too) is that "less is more".</td>', 'The eye roams here and never really settles on anything. The water flow grabs the eye, but then it''s drawn back across to the person, then down to the rock, then....too much here. Golden rule of photography ( and I opften forget it too) is that "less is more".', '2008-01-14 12:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
