(4391531, 632700, 66348, '<td valign="top">This shot is just incredible, I love the falls, mixed with the river in the back and adding just a touch of a building. Love the soft focus and compostion. It all works. Well done. Def a top 5!</td>', 'This shot is just incredible, I love the falls, mixed with the river in the back and adding just a touch of a building. Love the soft focus and compostion. It all works. Well done. Def a top 5!', '2008-01-14 14:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
