(4393140, 631592, 82814, '<td valign="top">A unique setting, but I have to wonder if there were a better angle for this shot somewhere.  The far right half of this image seems to detract from the subject waterfall and coloured stones.  The entire image may benefit from a cropping off of the top 1/4 and right 1/2???  You could also have crouched down closer to the ground and used the stones as a foreground bokeh.  Just a few thoughts to consider.  It''s easy for me to make these suggestions, but the option may not have been possible for you in this situation.</td>', 'A unique setting, but I have to wonder if there were a better angle for this shot somewhere.  The far right half of this image seems to detract from the subject waterfall and coloured stones.  The entire image may benefit from a cropping off of the top 1/4 and right 1/2???  You could also have crouched down closer to the ground and used the stones as a foreground bokeh.  Just a few thoughts to consider.  It''s easy for me to make these suggestions, but the option may not have been possible for you in this situation.', '2008-01-15 03:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
