(4394672, 632645, 65234, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, gorgeous, gorgeous!!  The arch of the bridge is a stunning frame, and the Washington Monument and Kennedy Center are perfectly positioned in it.  The movement from dark to light across the frame is beautiful, too.</td>', 'Gorgeous, gorgeous, gorgeous!!  The arch of the bridge is a stunning frame, and the Washington Monument and Kennedy Center are perfectly positioned in it.  The movement from dark to light across the frame is beautiful, too.', '2008-01-15 21:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
