(4394793, 631241, 65234, '<td valign="top">The starkness of this is really nice with all the varying silhouettes and the hint of color in the sky.  The water isn''t really the focal point but the bridge and walkway and probably even the city are there because of it.  I like the POV and angle you chose for this.</td>', 'The starkness of this is really nice with all the varying silhouettes and the hint of color in the sky.  The water isn''t really the focal point but the bridge and walkway and probably even the city are there because of it.  I like the POV and angle you chose for this.', '2008-01-15 21:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4394807, 632590, 65234, '<td valign="top">Stunning sky and beautifully detailed scene.  The water is actually a little too smooth for my taste, but everything else is so very right this is still one of my favorites in this challenge.  Marvelous image to just sit and contemplate for awhile.</td>', 'Stunning sky and beautifully detailed scene.  The water is actually a little too smooth for my taste, but everything else is so very right this is still one of my favorites in this challenge.  Marvelous image to just sit and contemplate for awhile.', '2008-01-15 21:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
