(4395165, 631851, 18367, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image which captures both the harshness of winter, as well as the striking beauty that emerges from such a stark environment. The colour of the forest and the fog in the background combine to make this a very appealing vista.<br/> <br/>It is unfortunate that the creek is frozen and covered in snow, and I do hope you do not fall victim to DNMC votes.  Good luck.</td>', 'A beautiful image which captures both the harshness of winter, as well as the striking beauty that emerges from such a stark environment. The colour of the forest and the fog in the background combine to make this a very appealing vista. It is unfortunate that the creek is frozen and covered in snow, and I do hope you do not fall victim to DNMC votes.  Good luck.', '2008-01-15 23:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
