(4399723, 631673, 72782, '<td valign="top">seems to be a bit too much yellow here</td>', 'seems to be a bit too much yellow here', '2008-01-17 11:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399729, 632711, 72782, '<td valign="top">Straighten!  Nice shot, Nice color, Nice composition, Maybe a little lighter would be better,but Straighten!</td>', 'Straighten!  Nice shot, Nice color, Nice composition, Maybe a little lighter would be better,but Straighten!', '2008-01-17 11:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399737, 631360, 72782, '<td valign="top">It looks like the image is tilted a bit, where the water first rounds the bend it is most noticable.  Nice shot.</td>', 'It looks like the image is tilted a bit, where the water first rounds the bend it is most noticable.  Nice shot.', '2008-01-17 11:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399739, 631291, 72782, '<td valign="top">WOW! COOL...</td>', 'WOW! COOL...', '2008-01-17 11:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399741, 632766, 72782, '<td valign="top">seems a bit to green to me</td>', 'seems a bit to green to me', '2008-01-17 11:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399744, 631908, 72782, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot</td>', 'Beautiful shot', '2008-01-17 11:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399749, 632880, 72782, '<td valign="top">very interesting texture</td>', 'very interesting texture', '2008-01-17 11:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399752, 632645, 72782, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot</td>', 'Fantastic shot', '2008-01-17 11:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399784, 632008, 72782, '<td valign="top">Very classic nice color nice composition, perfect softness to the water, maybe just a tinny bit more.  Love the lycens</td>', 'Very classic nice color nice composition, perfect softness to the water, maybe just a tinny bit more.  Love the lycens', '2008-01-17 11:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399803, 632590, 72782, '<td valign="top">What a great shot.  This would have been a great shot for Star trails.</td>', 'What a great shot.  This would have been a great shot for Star trails.', '2008-01-17 11:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399809, 632233, 72782, '<td valign="top">Just a little too dark</td>', 'Just a little too dark', '2008-01-17 11:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399845, 632464, 72782, '<td valign="top">to dark, a little lighter wold be nice</td>', 'to dark, a little lighter wold be nice', '2008-01-17 12:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399848, 630146, 72782, '<td valign="top">Not sure why it''s upside down.  Took some patients to get this shot.</td>', 'Not sure why it''s upside down.  Took some patients to get this shot.', '2008-01-17 12:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399850, 632471, 72782, '<td valign="top">looks to green,</td>', 'looks to green,', '2008-01-17 12:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399861, 631629, 84765, '<td valign="top">Maybe B&amp;W would have been better?</td>', 'Maybe B&W would have been better?', '2008-01-17 12:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399874, 632590, 84765, '<td valign="top">Wow - here we are. My absolut favorit!</td>', 'Wow - here we are. My absolut favorit!', '2008-01-17 12:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399876, 631378, 84765, '<td valign="top">Nice light. Very soft and clear</td>', 'Nice light. Very soft and clear', '2008-01-17 12:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399882, 632711, 84765, '<td valign="top">Strong colors, but maybe too much. Looks like a lot of Photoshop work. 6 from me.</td>', 'Strong colors, but maybe too much. Looks like a lot of Photoshop work. 6 from me.', '2008-01-17 12:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399885, 632136, 84765, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2008-01-17 12:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399992, 632583, 83313, '<td valign="top">Composition is good and I like the bold treatment of the colors. I''m not sure I care for the view with the small piece of the near bank showing. I think it ust seems like to ordinary a view is all it is.</td>', 'Composition is good and I like the bold treatment of the colors. I''m not sure I care for the view with the small piece of the near bank showing. I think it ust seems like to ordinary a view is all it is.', '2008-01-17 13:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400006, 632766, 83313, '<td valign="top">Lots of good stuff here and a couple of things that I don''t care for.  The waterfall is wonderful. Don''t think you could have captured that better. The branches at the top left interfere with the view of it, however and the tree on the right just slices through the frame without adding anything. I think a slightly different perspective may have framed this better. I''d like to see your outtakes of this after the challenge.</td>', 'Lots of good stuff here and a couple of things that I don''t care for.  The waterfall is wonderful. Don''t think you could have captured that better. The branches at the top left interfere with the view of it, however and the tree on the right just slices through the frame without adding anything. I think a slightly different perspective may have framed this better. I''d like to see your outtakes of this after the challenge.', '2008-01-17 13:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400012, 631300, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very good. I did some shots of the water under a pier a few months back and was not satisfied enough to post my resulting shots. Now I know what to try the next time I have that sort of scene.</td>', 'Very good. I did some shots of the water under a pier a few months back and was not satisfied enough to post my resulting shots. Now I know what to try the next time I have that sort of scene.', '2008-01-17 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400024, 631463, 83313, '<td valign="top">The moderately slow shutter speed you used gave this a neat effect. The rocks appear very sharp, while the water is almost unnatural looking in its smoothness. A little noise showing in the near part of the water. Not sure if you could eliminate that or not, given  the apparent lighting conditions this was shot in.</td>', 'The moderately slow shutter speed you used gave this a neat effect. The rocks appear very sharp, while the water is almost unnatural looking in its smoothness. A little noise showing in the near part of the water. Not sure if you could eliminate that or not, given  the apparent lighting conditions this was shot in.', '2008-01-17 13:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400031, 632811, 83313, '<td valign="top">Except for the bold sunset colors, there''s a lot of vacant space here. I think cropping or zooming it closer in toward that mountain, and enhancing it''s reflection would have worked very well.</td>', 'Except for the bold sunset colors, there''s a lot of vacant space here. I think cropping or zooming it closer in toward that mountain, and enhancing it''s reflection would have worked very well.', '2008-01-17 13:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400038, 632088, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very nice looking. I''d love to see the non-HDR version of this, just out of curiosity.</td>', 'Very nice looking. I''d love to see the non-HDR version of this, just out of curiosity.', '2008-01-17 13:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400045, 632648, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the way you enhanced the tones in this. The rope swing does not really stand out, though. It kind of gets lost in all the similar colors, and the absence of the swing changes the whole composition of the shot.</td>', 'I like the way you enhanced the tones in this. The rope swing does not really stand out, though. It kind of gets lost in all the similar colors, and the absence of the swing changes the whole composition of the shot.', '2008-01-17 13:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400047, 632886, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good, but some enhancement to make the water stand out better might have really made this pop.</td>', 'Good, but some enhancement to make the water stand out better might have really made this pop.', '2008-01-17 13:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400051, 632656, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the comp. The only thing bothering me is the impression of some skew. Looking at the tops of the buildings and horizon, it appears to be straight, but the river itself gives a skewed impression to me.</td>', 'I like the comp. The only thing bothering me is the impression of some skew. Looking at the tops of the buildings and horizon, it appears to be straight, but the river itself gives a skewed impression to me.', '2008-01-17 13:34:57.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4400054, 632595, 811, '<td valign="top">Good focus and exposure, there just isn''t a lot to compel the viewer to stay and look, I don''t think.</td>', 'Good focus and exposure, there just isn''t a lot to compel the viewer to stay and look, I don''t think.', '2008-01-17 13:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400055, 631326, 83313, '<td valign="top">Love it. great wet texture and color showing. Cropped in a touch more at the top might have improved the comp a little bit.</td>', 'Love it. great wet texture and color showing. Cropped in a touch more at the top might have improved the comp a little bit.', '2008-01-17 13:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400056, 632612, 811, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  I think if the focus was a bit sharper on the dog, it would be even better.</td>', 'Good composition.  I think if the focus was a bit sharper on the dog, it would be even better.', '2008-01-17 13:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400057, 632055, 811, '<td valign="top">Seems slightly tilted to the right, but I like the mist and the objects sticking up out of the water</td>', 'Seems slightly tilted to the right, but I like the mist and the objects sticking up out of the water', '2008-01-17 13:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400062, 632646, 88352, '<td valign="top">Ouch.</td>', 'Ouch.', '2008-01-17 13:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400064, 631842, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very nice take on the theme. The horizon is a bit too centered for me. I think you could have cropped out a bit off the top clouds and still gotten the same look.</td>', 'Very nice take on the theme. The horizon is a bit too centered for me. I think you could have cropped out a bit off the top clouds and still gotten the same look.', '2008-01-17 13:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400065, 632614, 811, '<td valign="top">The leaf is too centered, I think.  In one of the corners would really give the opportunity to use the negative space to really emphasize the "solitude" part of your shot.  Also, your file size seems really small.  Making it bigger might give it a bit more impact as well.</td>', 'The leaf is too centered, I think.  In one of the corners would really give the opportunity to use the negative space to really emphasize the "solitude" part of your shot.  Also, your file size seems really small.  Making it bigger might give it a bit more impact as well.', '2008-01-17 13:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400146, 630146, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the shade of blue in this and the simplicity of the shot.</td>', 'I like the shade of blue in this and the simplicity of the shot.', '2008-01-17 14:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400149, 632786, 811, '<td valign="top">I like how the darkness at the top right, the  water, and the grass at the bottom left form three distinct "strata" in the shot.  I think you could almost crop the bridge out of the shot completely because of that (but then you would need a new title).  It is a bit grainy, I think, but perhaps that is intentional.</td>', 'I like how the darkness at the top right, the  water, and the grass at the bottom left form three distinct "strata" in the shot.  I think you could almost crop the bridge out of the shot completely because of that (but then you would need a new title).  It is a bit grainy, I think, but perhaps that is intentional.', '2008-01-17 14:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400152, 631919, 811, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  I like the balance of the composition.</td>', 'Lovely shot.  I like the balance of the composition.', '2008-01-17 14:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400159, 630562, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice color and silhouette</td>', 'Nice color and silhouette', '2008-01-17 14:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400164, 632097, 811, '<td valign="top">Good balanced composition and details.  Seems a bit tilted to the right in the far distance.</td>', 'Good balanced composition and details.  Seems a bit tilted to the right in the far distance.', '2008-01-17 14:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400167, 631308, 811, '<td valign="top">Great colors and definition.  Good composition as well.  I like how the leaves underneath are darker and subdued -- it really makes the one stand out nicely.</td>', 'Great colors and definition.  Good composition as well.  I like how the leaves underneath are darker and subdued -- it really makes the one stand out nicely.', '2008-01-17 14:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400172, 632645, 811, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice.  I like the rich colors in this and the excellent clarity.</td>', 'Very, very nice.  I like the rich colors in this and the excellent clarity.', '2008-01-17 14:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400177, 631851, 811, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful picture.  I am assuming that is a frozen creek bed in the middle there.  :)  Would hate to think something this nice "dnmc."</td>', 'This is a beautiful picture.  I am assuming that is a frozen creek bed in the middle there.  :)  Would hate to think something this nice "dnmc."', '2008-01-17 14:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400183, 632716, 811, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  I like the colors and clarity of this shot.</td>', 'Very nicely done.  I like the colors and clarity of this shot.', '2008-01-17 14:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400191, 631360, 811, '<td valign="top">Good colors and details in this.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'Good colors and details in this.  Very nicely done.', '2008-01-17 14:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400202, 631136, 811, '<td valign="top">The main building seems just a touch too centered (left to right) I think.  Maybe if there were more "space" at the left, the leading lines you have would be even more effective.</td>', 'The main building seems just a touch too centered (left to right) I think.  Maybe if there were more "space" at the left, the leading lines you have would be even more effective.', '2008-01-17 14:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400215, 632183, 811, '<td valign="top">In a way, I like the selective coloring you have here, but it almost seems to random to be completely comfortable.</td>', 'In a way, I like the selective coloring you have here, but it almost seems to random to be completely comfortable.', '2008-01-17 14:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400227, 630995, 811, '<td valign="top">Ouch.  Makes you wonder about the story behind this one.</td>', 'Ouch.  Makes you wonder about the story behind this one.', '2008-01-17 14:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400231, 632226, 811, '<td valign="top">The sword adds an interesting touch, but it would have been a lovely scene without it as well.</td>', 'The sword adds an interesting touch, but it would have been a lovely scene without it as well.', '2008-01-17 14:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400234, 630936, 811, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the effect the mist/fog has on the overall shot.</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the effect the mist/fog has on the overall shot.', '2008-01-17 14:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400321, 631122, 41794, '<td valign="top">I like the ground, definately has that winter feel to it. The sky being so bright doesn''t do anything for me. I would have preferred a tighter crop cancelling out some of that sky, but then that would take out the silhouette of the tall tree....</td>', 'I like the ground, definately has that winter feel to it. The sky being so bright doesn''t do anything for me. I would have preferred a tighter crop cancelling out some of that sky, but then that would take out the silhouette of the tall tree....', '2008-01-17 14:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400324, 632687, 41794, '<td valign="top">I really like this, especially in black and white. Reminds me of some of the christmas cards I saw this year.</td>', 'I really like this, especially in black and white. Reminds me of some of the christmas cards I saw this year.', '2008-01-17 14:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400326, 632850, 41794, '<td valign="top">This is really nice, good flowing water and the contrast of the ligher color water at the top of the falls from the sun and the "bluer" hues down below works well.</td>', 'This is really nice, good flowing water and the contrast of the ligher color water at the top of the falls from the sun and the "bluer" hues down below works well.', '2008-01-17 14:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400327, 632599, 41794, '<td valign="top">Very eerie.</td>', 'Very eerie.', '2008-01-17 14:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400328, 631903, 41794, '<td valign="top">Very mellow and relaxing.</td>', 'Very mellow and relaxing.', '2008-01-17 14:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400331, 632207, 41794, '<td valign="top">Just my opinion, but I think some dodge and burn on the ground would have helped this "pop" a little more.</td>', 'Just my opinion, but I think some dodge and burn on the ground would have helped this "pop" a little more.', '2008-01-17 14:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400336, 632381, 41794, '<td valign="top">Beautiful waterfall, but the rocks don''t seem sharp enough to me.</td>', 'Beautiful waterfall, but the rocks don''t seem sharp enough to me.', '2008-01-17 14:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400349, 631534, 83313, '<td valign="top">Overall, I like this, though I think the strong sunset tones on the right overpower the left side that is in shadows.</td>', 'Overall, I like this, though I think the strong sunset tones on the right overpower the left side that is in shadows.', '2008-01-17 15:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400379, 632021, 83313, '<td valign="top">I would have probably done a taller and narrower crop on this, but that''s nitpicking. S''good. I really like the texture and color of the footbridge.</td>', 'I would have probably done a taller and narrower crop on this, but that''s nitpicking. S''good. I really like the texture and color of the footbridge.', '2008-01-17 15:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400398, 632817, 83313, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look like the Bronx that I am familiar with! I think the perspective is too plain. Getting down for a lower shot of this would have probably punched it up quite a bit and made those rocks in the river really stand out as a feature.</td>', 'Doesn''t look like the Bronx that I am familiar with! I think the perspective is too plain. Getting down for a lower shot of this would have probably punched it up quite a bit and made those rocks in the river really stand out as a feature.', '2008-01-17 15:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400406, 632240, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is nice, though it looks nearly straight out of the camera. A little tweaking of curves would really give this some kick.</td>', 'This is nice, though it looks nearly straight out of the camera. A little tweaking of curves would really give this some kick.', '2008-01-17 15:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400413, 632381, 83313, '<td valign="top">Clarity is slightly lacking, as if this is a tight crop or at the long end of a zoom. Otherwise, this is a wonderful shot.</td>', 'Clarity is slightly lacking, as if this is a tight crop or at the long end of a zoom. Otherwise, this is a wonderful shot.', '2008-01-17 15:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400419, 632585, 83313, '<td valign="top">Would have loved to see a little more detail. I am not sure if this dark look is intentionally done, or is a result of the shooting conditions. The comp is great and I really like the way this looks overall.</td>', 'Would have loved to see a little more detail. I am not sure if this dark look is intentionally done, or is a result of the shooting conditions. The comp is great and I really like the way this looks overall.', '2008-01-17 15:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400422, 632847, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not keen on the vignetting, otherwise this is awesome.</td>', 'I''m not keen on the vignetting, otherwise this is awesome.', '2008-01-17 15:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400519, 632711, 88796, '<td valign="top">Nice color and sharpness!</td>', 'Nice color and sharpness!', '2008-01-17 16:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400527, 632200, 88796, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like the white inner border, greens are a little bright.  A little sharper and I would have liked this photo alot more.</td>', 'I don''t really like the white inner border, greens are a little bright.  A little sharper and I would have liked this photo alot more.', '2008-01-17 16:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400531, 632583, 88796, '<td valign="top">Grass looks great!</td>', 'Grass looks great!', '2008-01-17 16:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400545, 631700, 88796, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed photo, if it were sharper it would look better.</td>', 'Nicely composed photo, if it were sharper it would look better.', '2008-01-17 16:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400548, 630852, 88796, '<td valign="top">Nice photo!</td>', 'Nice photo!', '2008-01-17 16:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400562, 630468, 88796, '<td valign="top">Nice greens! Loving the sky.</td>', 'Nice greens! Loving the sky.', '2008-01-17 16:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400599, 632464, 88796, '<td valign="top">Nice! I like the low clouds and how sharp the edges of them are with the light behind. 10!</td>', 'Nice! I like the low clouds and how sharp the edges of them are with the light behind. 10!', '2008-01-17 16:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400600, 632843, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the tones and textures of this.  Neat, in an abstract way.</td>', 'I like the tones and textures of this.  Neat, in an abstract way.', '2008-01-17 16:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400606, 632008, 811, '<td valign="top">Great composition and exposure.  Very nice sot.</td>', 'Great composition and exposure.  Very nice sot.', '2008-01-17 16:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400613, 631358, 83313, '<td valign="top">Now THAT''s great looking! Simple and elegant. Texture, color, contrast, this one has it nailed..</td>', 'Now THAT''s great looking! Simple and elegant. Texture, color, contrast, this one has it nailed..', '2008-01-17 16:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400619, 632705, 811, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  Maybe a touch overexposed on the water.</td>', 'Good composition.  Maybe a touch overexposed on the water.', '2008-01-17 16:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400622, 632760, 811, '<td valign="top">That looks rather cold.</td>', 'That looks rather cold.', '2008-01-17 16:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400626, 632471, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks chilly out. Maybe a touch more contrast would be good.</td>', 'Looks chilly out. Maybe a touch more contrast would be good.', '2008-01-17 16:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400639, 632878, 811, '<td valign="top">The intense sun in the upper left really adds to the overall feeling/mood fo the shot.</td>', 'The intense sun in the upper left really adds to the overall feeling/mood fo the shot.', '2008-01-17 16:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400646, 632867, 83313, '<td valign="top">A different view may have worked better. I think the modern office building behind it hurts the look, and the most fascinating part, the drawbridge mechanism, is barely visible in the frame. <br/> <br/>Lot of JPEG compression artifacts showing around the edges of the buildings. You used only about 1/3 of the allowable file size and a much smaller pixel size than was allowed for this challenge (200k and 720 pixels). Lowering the compression amount and using a larger image size would improve image quality.</td>', 'A different view may have worked better. I think the modern office building behind it hurts the look, and the most fascinating part, the drawbridge mechanism, is barely visible in the frame.  Lot of JPEG compression artifacts showing around the edges of the buildings. You used only about 1/3 of the allowable file size and a much smaller pixel size than was allowed for this challenge (200k and 720 pixels). Lowering the compression amount and using a larger image size would improve image quality.', '2008-01-17 16:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400663, 632387, 58610, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2008-01-17 16:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400668, 632450, 58610, '<td valign="top">Disorienting, in a good way.</td>', 'Disorienting, in a good way.', '2008-01-17 16:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400670, 632764, 58610, '<td valign="top">Glad you found it for us!</td>', 'Glad you found it for us!', '2008-01-17 16:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400672, 632461, 811, '<td valign="top">If the area around the duck were sharper, the blur of the duck/goose would actually be more effective.  As it is, though, it just looks blurry throughout.</td>', 'If the area around the duck were sharper, the blur of the duck/goose would actually be more effective.  As it is, though, it just looks blurry throughout.', '2008-01-17 16:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400673, 632687, 58610, '<td valign="top">I''d like to be there when it returns.</td>', 'I''d like to be there when it returns.', '2008-01-17 16:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400674, 630166, 58610, '<td valign="top">Lol!</td>', 'Lol!', '2008-01-17 16:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400675, 632786, 83313, '<td valign="top">The grain almost makes this look like an illustration, which I like. I''m not sure the narrow slice of the bridge at the top of the frame works, though.</td>', 'The grain almost makes this look like an illustration, which I like. I''m not sure the narrow slice of the bridge at the top of the frame works, though.', '2008-01-17 16:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400676, 632687, 811, '<td valign="top">Beautifully shot.  Composition, exposure, lighting, etc. all work together to make this a very well done shot.</td>', 'Beautifully shot.  Composition, exposure, lighting, etc. all work together to make this a very well done shot.', '2008-01-17 16:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400677, 631592, 811, '<td valign="top">Those are some cool colors on the rocks</td>', 'Those are some cool colors on the rocks', '2008-01-17 16:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
