(4400832, 631122, 42013, '<td valign="top">I like the starkness of the photo, however, the bright sky(50% of the frame) overwhelms the lines of the trees. Not exactly sure how you could improve short of shooting at a different time of day. I see a little wierd blue color around the branches of the foreground tree so maybe the sky had some color in the original... Just my .02...trying to leave comments on the images near the bottom of my voting.</td>', 'I like the starkness of the photo, however, the bright sky(50% of the frame) overwhelms the lines of the trees. Not exactly sure how you could improve short of shooting at a different time of day. I see a little wierd blue color around the branches of the foreground tree so maybe the sky had some color in the original... Just my .02...trying to leave comments on the images near the bottom of my voting.', '2008-01-17 17:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400895, 632214, 88796, '<td valign="top">The trees behind the bridge look oddly desaturated, a bit of color in that area would have made the photo.</td>', 'The trees behind the bridge look oddly desaturated, a bit of color in that area would have made the photo.', '2008-01-17 17:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400909, 632585, 42013, '<td valign="top">A very contrasty scene and one in which you have portrayed the movement of the water in a nice way. I do feel it could be improved by some increased detail in the shadow areas. The picture feels pretty soft in spots, not sure if that is a product of cropping or your processing. Your composition is good.</td>', 'A very contrasty scene and one in which you have portrayed the movement of the water in a nice way. I do feel it could be improved by some increased detail in the shadow areas. The picture feels pretty soft in spots, not sure if that is a product of cropping or your processing. Your composition is good.', '2008-01-17 18:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400942, 632843, 42013, '<td valign="top">I like the muted color tones but feel the images suffers from either poor focus or slow shutter speed, making the bubbles come out a little fuzzy when they should be emphasized. You do have the light dancing accross the bottom for some added interest.</td>', 'I like the muted color tones but feel the images suffers from either poor focus or slow shutter speed, making the bubbles come out a little fuzzy when they should be emphasized. You do have the light dancing accross the bottom for some added interest.', '2008-01-17 18:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4400943, 630451, 42013, '<td valign="top">Good reflections in the water, and fairly strong composition. It is one of those pictures where I''m not sure if I should flip it over to see it correctly! I find the green of the water rather odd agains the the heavy browns and the vignetting perhaps a little heavy.</td>', 'Good reflections in the water, and fairly strong composition. It is one of those pictures where I''m not sure if I should flip it over to see it correctly! I find the green of the water rather odd agains the the heavy browns and the vignetting perhaps a little heavy.', '2008-01-17 18:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
