(4403885, 632206, 83313, '<td valign="top">I can swear I voted on this same bridge yesterday. Of course, there are many folks who go out shooting together.<br/> <br/>I really like the detail and appearance of the bridge, but the comp just is not working for me. My eye is drawn away from the subject. I find my eye flows from the upper right, down the bridge to an empty bank with little interest. <br/> <br/>If this is some thing close to you that you can go back to, I would love to see   some other perspectives on tis bridge.</td>', 'I can swear I voted on this same bridge yesterday. Of course, there are many folks who go out shooting together. I really like the detail and appearance of the bridge, but the comp just is not working for me. My eye is drawn away from the subject. I find my eye flows from the upper right, down the bridge to an empty bank with little interest.  If this is some thing close to you that you can go back to, I would love to see   some other perspectives on tis bridge.', '2008-01-18 23:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403888, 632764, 83313, '<td valign="top">It seems a little tilted, but otherwise I like this. The curve of the river leads one right to the cleft in the mountains.</td>', 'It seems a little tilted, but otherwise I like this. The curve of the river leads one right to the cleft in the mountains.', '2008-01-18 23:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
