(4404411, 632817, 63244, '<td valign="top">I like the shadows and the light play on the right of the photograph.  Perhaps using a touch longer exposure and you would gently blur the water movement to better contrast with the very sharp surroundings.  Nicely frames.</td>', 'I like the shadows and the light play on the right of the photograph.  Perhaps using a touch longer exposure and you would gently blur the water movement to better contrast with the very sharp surroundings.  Nicely frames.', '2008-01-19 10:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4404426, 632700, 63244, '<td valign="top">This appears a bit dark on my monitor (and I''m sure it is just my monitor).  This has such a comforting look to it. You''ve done a wonderful job on the water flow...and the details of the stone wall are excellent. I wish the lacy pines across the way showed a bit more.  Nice place.  Nice photogrqaph!</td>', 'This appears a bit dark on my monitor (and I''m sure it is just my monitor).  This has such a comforting look to it. You''ve done a wonderful job on the water flow...and the details of the stone wall are excellent. I wish the lacy pines across the way showed a bit more.  Nice place.  Nice photogrqaph!', '2008-01-19 10:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4404443, 632834, 63244, '<td valign="top">This is lovely.  I''m detecting a hint of a color shift though. The tree serves as framing, but I think it takes away from the beauty of the shot.   I would try cropping it more or maybe crop it out completely? Just a thought. Very nice photograph.</td>', 'This is lovely.  I''m detecting a hint of a color shift though. The tree serves as framing, but I think it takes away from the beauty of the shot.   I would try cropping it more or maybe crop it out completely? Just a thought. Very nice photograph.', '2008-01-19 10:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4404448, 631851, 63244, '<td valign="top">The is perfect.  Your DOF makes the background gently fad into nothing, thus drawing you into the immediate tree line in front. I''m glad you chose NOT to make this black and white as it''s beautiful in color.  Wonderful detail.</td>', 'The is perfect.  Your DOF makes the background gently fad into nothing, thus drawing you into the immediate tree line in front. I''m glad you chose NOT to make this black and white as it''s beautiful in color.  Wonderful detail.', '2008-01-19 10:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4404452, 632716, 63244, '<td valign="top">The colors in this shot are very nice! Youve framed the waterfall well with the foreground.  Wondering if you''ve taken too much noise out of the pool as it looks a touch flat, yet background and foreground are tack sharp.  (What do I know...)Beautifully done.</td>', 'The colors in this shot are very nice! Youve framed the waterfall well with the foreground.  Wondering if you''ve taken too much noise out of the pool as it looks a touch flat, yet background and foreground are tack sharp.  (What do I know...)Beautifully done.', '2008-01-19 10:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4404457, 631129, 63244, '<td valign="top">Lots going on in this shot. There is some very nice detail.</td>', 'Lots going on in this shot. There is some very nice detail.', '2008-01-19 10:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4404463, 631926, 63244, '<td valign="top">I think I would have aimed the focus at the top of the grass and let the rest blur out. Right now your focus is on the base of the stocks and isn''t so interesting.  Sorry.</td>', 'I think I would have aimed the focus at the top of the grass and let the rest blur out. Right now your focus is on the base of the stocks and isn''t so interesting.  Sorry.', '2008-01-19 10:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4404468, 631876, 63244, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice composition, but there is nothing very sharp in the photograph to focus on.  Your water has a great diagonal movement from corner to corner, but the color tone is more sepia feeling, where my brain makes me normally think blue...cooler. I''d like to see the color version.</td>', 'This is a very nice composition, but there is nothing very sharp in the photograph to focus on.  Your water has a great diagonal movement from corner to corner, but the color tone is more sepia feeling, where my brain makes me normally think blue...cooler. I''d like to see the color version.', '2008-01-19 11:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4404472, 630160, 63244, '<td valign="top">This holds no particular interest for me (looks like everything around here, lol), but you''re getting points for the title!! The pooling in the foreground and the way the trees angle leads the eye through the photograph.  The colors are nice.</td>', 'This holds no particular interest for me (looks like everything around here, lol), but you''re getting points for the title!! The pooling in the foreground and the way the trees angle leads the eye through the photograph.  The colors are nice.', '2008-01-19 11:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4404473, 632847, 63244, '<td valign="top">Stunning!!  I love the colors and the textures here.  The slight vinetting really helps frame the shot.  Nicely done~~This should do well.</td>', 'Stunning!!  I love the colors and the textures here.  The slight vinetting really helps frame the shot.  Nicely done~~This should do well.', '2008-01-19 11:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
