(4404478, 632188, 63244, '<td valign="top">Too HDR for me...I''m not used to blue rocks.  The green looks absolutely toxic, lol, but a beautiful color. It''s a great shot, just not my cup o'' tea. 6</td>', 'Too HDR for me...I''m not used to blue rocks.  The green looks absolutely toxic, lol, but a beautiful color. It''s a great shot, just not my cup o'' tea. 6', '2008-01-19 11:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4404482, 632635, 63244, '<td valign="top">Need a different crop.  The subject is water, thus you want more water and less sky in your shot.  It will emphasis more. Right now...the building is the only subject and it''s a bullseye to boot.  Try reshooting this from a lower angle, with more water and less sky.  The perspective may drastically change.  Nice idea. (Love the building.)</td>', 'Need a different crop.  The subject is water, thus you want more water and less sky in your shot.  It will emphasis more. Right now...the building is the only subject and it''s a bullseye to boot.  Try reshooting this from a lower angle, with more water and less sky.  The perspective may drastically change.  Nice idea. (Love the building.)', '2008-01-19 11:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
