(4408499, 631908, 30861, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, indeed. A little lacking in "drama", but just beautifully rendered.</td>', 'Nicely done, indeed. A little lacking in "drama", but just beautifully rendered.', '2008-01-21 00:51:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4408504, 630468, 30861, '<td valign="top">If the foreground greens had not been pushed tot he point of being cartoonish, I bet this would have made top 10. A beautifully-seen scene, so to speak :-)</td>', 'If the foreground greens had not been pushed tot he point of being cartoonish, I bet this would have made top 10. A beautifully-seen scene, so to speak :-)', '2008-01-21 00:53:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4408507, 632002, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like it.  It''s an optimistic kind of photo.  I like that the water stands apart from all the brown.</td>', 'I like it.  It''s an optimistic kind of photo.  I like that the water stands apart from all the brown.', '2008-01-21 00:53:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4408508, 631726, 27133, '<td valign="top">Congrats on beating me.</td>', 'Congrats on beating me.', '2008-01-21 00:54:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4408513, 632107, 30861, '<td valign="top">We have a "Swan River" on Cape Cod near where I live too :-) One of my almost-entered outtakes was shot there; would have been fun to have two images with the same title... Congrats on top-20. How did yiou get the elevation? Are you flying, or is there a tall building?</td>', 'We have a "Swan River" on Cape Cod near where I live too :-) One of my almost-entered outtakes was shot there; would have been fun to have two images with the same title... Congrats on top-20. How did yiou get the elevation? Are you flying, or is there a tall building?', '2008-01-21 00:55:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4408515, 631552, 34938, '<td valign="top">FINALLY YOU BROKE THE DROUGHT!!! Well done...I didn''t vote in this challenge as I was away, but this would have been a 10 from me...</td>', 'FINALLY YOU BROKE THE DROUGHT!!! Well done...I didn''t vote in this challenge as I was away, but this would have been a 10 from me...', '2008-01-21 00:55:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4408518, 630166, 67697, '<td valign="top">That''s a shame - this really does not deserve to score below 5.  I love seeing the ice chunks, the swirls of water, and the mist.  There''s a lot to see here and that is what makes this interesting.</td>', 'That''s a shame - this really does not deserve to score below 5.  I love seeing the ice chunks, the swirls of water, and the mist.  There''s a lot to see here and that is what makes this interesting.', '2008-01-21 00:55:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4408521, 632590, 34938, '<td valign="top">ICELAND AGAIN! Of course! Iceland Rocks...<br/> <br/>I didn''t get to vote in this challenge, but this is a clear winner...congratulations, and a great score to boot...well done</td>', 'ICELAND AGAIN! Of course! Iceland Rocks... I didn''t get to vote in this challenge, but this is a clear winner...congratulations, and a great score to boot...well done', '2008-01-21 00:56:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4408522, 632416, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is really nice. I love the muted palette of it. The border overpowers it a bit IMO, but not too seriously. Congrats on top-20.</td>', 'This is really nice. I love the muted palette of it. The border overpowers it a bit IMO, but not too seriously. Congrats on top-20.', '2008-01-21 00:56:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4408524, 631246, 34938, '<td valign="top">You really do these images so well Robert...you are a master HDR person...congrats</td>', 'You really do these images so well Robert...you are a master HDR person...congrats', '2008-01-21 00:57:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4408530, 632035, 30861, '<td valign="top">I had thought this would do a bit better, actually. It''s a fantastic contrast of elemental and human. The tone mapping may have flattened it a little too much. Congrats on top-20.</td>', 'I had thought this would do a bit better, actually. It''s a fantastic contrast of elemental and human. The tone mapping may have flattened it a little too much. Congrats on top-20.', '2008-01-21 00:58:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4408531, 632645, 34938, '<td valign="top">Well done Jeffrey...congrats on the HM, it sucks to be forth!!!! But anyway, this is a personal best for you sin''t it???</td>', 'Well done Jeffrey...congrats on the HM, it sucks to be forth!!!! But anyway, this is a personal best for you sin''t it???', '2008-01-21 00:58:48.000000', NULL, 0),
