(4408885, 631246, 74371, '<td valign="top">This was my favorite of the Challenge. My only 10, I had no doubt that it would ribbon!<br/> <br/>Congrats, Bear! A simply stunning photograph!!!</td>', 'This was my favorite of the Challenge. My only 10, I had no doubt that it would ribbon! Congrats, Bear! A simply stunning photograph!!!', '2008-01-21 02:16:18.000000', NULL, 0),
