(4409047, 632021, 68035, '<td valign="top">Beautiful range of earth colours here which make the picture look really autumnal.  The rickety bridge is cool (I bet that a troll lives under it) and I like the fact that on the left side of it there is virtually no reflections yet on the right there is a cool sharp one of the tree.<br/> <br/>Nice shot and all the better for being one you like<br/> <br/></td>', 'Beautiful range of earth colours here which make the picture look really autumnal.  The rickety bridge is cool (I bet that a troll lives under it) and I like the fact that on the left side of it there is virtually no reflections yet on the right there is a cool sharp one of the tree. Nice shot and all the better for being one you like ', '2008-01-21 03:47:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4409051, 631246, 25355, '<td valign="top">Well, done Robert.  You certainly gave this scene an almost ethereal quality. You are a master of HDR. (I wonder if you''re ever going to try your hand at Grunge? ;-Þ )</td>', 'Well, done Robert.  You certainly gave this scene an almost ethereal quality. You are a master of HDR. (I wonder if you''re ever going to try your hand at Grunge? ;-Þ )', '2008-01-21 03:49:25.000000', NULL, 0),
