(4411116, 631900, 66384, '<td valign="top">Well, as you know, I like this image. The composition is what I like best, and the drama of the rapid water. I do agree with some of the comments that the blown highlights are unfortunate. But I disagree that the branches are distracting. I think they give depth and interest to the scene.</td>', 'Well, as you know, I like this image. The composition is what I like best, and the drama of the rapid water. I do agree with some of the comments that the blown highlights are unfortunate. But I disagree that the branches are distracting. I think they give depth and interest to the scene.', '2008-01-21 16:28:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4411131, 631403, 66384, '<td valign="top">Wonderful moody shot, Bob. The water and the fog give me the feel of being right there in the scene. The misty tree in the distance is an excellent touch.</td>', 'Wonderful moody shot, Bob. The water and the fog give me the feel of being right there in the scene. The misty tree in the distance is an excellent touch.', '2008-01-21 16:36:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4411139, 632878, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, Jason. Where did all the water go? I like shots of the woods and I know how hard it is to get the light right. This makes me want to follow that dry stream around the curve to see where it''s going. I am really drawn into the image.</td>', 'Nice shot, Jason. Where did all the water go? I like shots of the woods and I know how hard it is to get the light right. This makes me want to follow that dry stream around the curve to see where it''s going. I am really drawn into the image.', '2008-01-21 16:39:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4411159, 632535, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is a classic. I would love to work on a jigsaw puzzle of this image. I envy how you have mastered this HDR technique. Congratulations on an excellent entry and top 20 placement.</td>', 'This is a classic. I would love to work on a jigsaw puzzle of this image. I envy how you have mastered this HDR technique. Congratulations on an excellent entry and top 20 placement.', '2008-01-21 16:47:49.000000', NULL, 0),
