(4411187, 632875, 66384, '<td valign="top">I really like what the tone mapping has done for the trees and the rocks. The water and the sky didn''t fair quite so well. They look very unnatural. The scene is beautiful. I love the light and composition.</td>', 'I really like what the tone mapping has done for the trees and the rocks. The water and the sky didn''t fair quite so well. They look very unnatural. The scene is beautiful. I love the light and composition.', '2008-01-21 16:58:33.000000', NULL, 0),
