(4413320, 630146, 3102, '<td valign="top">So you''re admitting that your entry doesn''t meet the challenge, yet you''re complaining that I was pointing that out?  There''s no law that says you have to enter every challenge.  If you enter something that doesn''t meet the challenge, you should have some expectation that people are going to make note of that.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by antje:</b></div><hr/><i> Your sarcasm is even less impressive....I know I missed the theme...no bridges where I am...hmmmm </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'So you''re admitting that your entry doesn''t meet the challenge, yet you''re complaining that I was pointing that out?  There''s no law that says you have to enter every challenge.  If you enter something that doesn''t meet the challenge, you should have some expectation that people are going to make note of that. Originally posted by antje: Your sarcasm is even less impressive....I know I missed the theme...no bridges where I am...hmmmm ', '2008-01-22 10:02:23.000000', NULL, 0),
