(4413911, 631552, 5354, '<td valign="top">Now Doc, you know I have first call on these sort of shots ;-)<br/>To be honest I''d have been proud to take this image, it is simply beautiful. The colours in those rocks and the blue/green water is what really makes it. Most of the waterfalls around here are from peaty moorland and tend to be ''tea'' coloured so its nice to see something different.<br/> <br/>Never got round to tasking one myself, I was in San Antonio and there''s only the plastic riverwalk which was never going to compete against an image of this quality.<br/> <br/>Congrats my friend, well done.<br/> <br/>K</td>', 'Now Doc, you know I have first call on these sort of shots ;-)To be honest I''d have been proud to take this image, it is simply beautiful. The colours in those rocks and the blue/green water is what really makes it. Most of the waterfalls around here are from peaty moorland and tend to be ''tea'' coloured so its nice to see something different. Never got round to tasking one myself, I was in San Antonio and there''s only the plastic riverwalk which was never going to compete against an image of this quality. Congrats my friend, well done. K', '2008-01-22 13:44:33.000000', NULL, 0),
