(4630170, 631403, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love how reflections seem to be capable of merging two worlds into one... this is a WONDERFUL shot. Excellent work!</td>', 'I love how reflections seem to be capable of merging two worlds into one... this is a WONDERFUL shot. Excellent work!', '2008-04-10 13:05:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4640071, 632200, 39427, '<td valign="top">this photo might be too busy for some, and might have more impact in a higher resolution, but I think this is a great capture with tons of visual interest, and was severely underrated in the challenge.  I''m really enjoying the array of colors and the sort of bleached out look you''ve achieved here.</td>', 'this photo might be too busy for some, and might have more impact in a higher resolution, but I think this is a great capture with tons of visual interest, and was severely underrated in the challenge.  I''m really enjoying the array of colors and the sort of bleached out look you''ve achieved here.', '2008-04-15 01:18:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4684763, 632764, 73980, '<td valign="top">Beautiful view, congrats on the 30 spot!</td>', 'Beautiful view, congrats on the 30 spot!', '2008-05-06 15:08:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4704969, 632376, 48954, '<td valign="top">underrated!</td>', 'underrated!', '2008-05-15 18:27:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4721441, 632447, 77196, '<td valign="top">Those grasses to the left of the boathouse are huge! At first glance, this looks like a miniature. Gotta love that morning light! Beautiful reflections on the river. <br/> <br/>The only thing that I think works against this shot is the empty space in the upper right. I wonder if you mirrored the image, so the blank space (lawn) was leading edge if that would "improve" it.</td>', 'Those grasses to the left of the boathouse are huge! At first glance, this looks like a miniature. Gotta love that morning light! Beautiful reflections on the river.  The only thing that I think works against this shot is the empty space in the upper right. I wonder if you mirrored the image, so the blank space (lawn) was leading edge if that would "improve" it.', '2008-05-24 13:31:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4735786, 632850, 20506, '<td valign="top">very cool pardon the pun! I love the long excposure effect. maybe would have lost some of the big white area on the bottom right it''s a little distracting to the eye. But all in all I''d hang it on my wall good work.</td>', 'very cool pardon the pun! I love the long excposure effect. maybe would have lost some of the big white area on the bottom right it''s a little distracting to the eye. But all in all I''d hang it on my wall good work.', '2008-05-31 03:35:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4770240, 632313, 49804, '<td valign="top">Phenomenal, nailed the exposure, nailed the tones, nailed the composition, nearly a perfect shot imo, really a nice job here, adding to faves.</td>', 'Phenomenal, nailed the exposure, nailed the tones, nailed the composition, nearly a perfect shot imo, really a nice job here, adding to faves.', '2008-06-15 22:51:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4805640, 631403, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great shot, very subdued, very nice compostion, with interesting and repeating elements. Also the glassyness of the water is super. Great without a polarizer! Nice shot.</td>', 'Great shot, very subdued, very nice compostion, with interesting and repeating elements. Also the glassyness of the water is super. Great without a polarizer! Nice shot.', '2008-07-05 20:31:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4805649, 631241, 12611, '<td valign="top">This was a vastly underated shot; I don''t think that people could see through the contrast and strength that the foreground frame creates, and just appreciate the shot. I Like it though, and thats got to count for something.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-07-06 19:22:49.</i></td>', 'This was a vastly underated shot; I don''t think that people could see through the contrast and strength that the foreground frame creates, and just appreciate the shot. I Like it though, and thats got to count for something.', '2008-07-05 20:33:21.000000', '2008-07-06 20:22:49.000000', 0),
(4855440, 632002, 95697, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Pan''s Labyrinth (it might be spelled different - I can''t remember the correct English title) - it''s kinda creepy but in a beautiful way...</td>', 'Reminds me of Pan''s Labyrinth (it might be spelled different - I can''t remember the correct English title) - it''s kinda creepy but in a beautiful way...', '2008-08-01 10:26:49.000000', NULL, 0),
