(4977408, 631246, 94601, '<td valign="top">Bear- your pictures are phenomenal.  Absolutely breathtaking.  You have a great knack to not only find great landscapes, but to shoot the well, and edit them perfectly.<br/> <br/>I look forward to seeing more of your work!</td>', 'Bear- your pictures are phenomenal.  Absolutely breathtaking.  You have a great knack to not only find great landscapes, but to shoot the well, and edit them perfectly. I look forward to seeing more of your work!', '2008-09-26 22:26:55.000000', NULL, 0),
