(5197500, 632646, 28742, '<td valign="top"><b>My 10,000th comment:</b> <br/>I actually voted on this one - a 4??? WTF was I thinking?? Drinking must''ve affected my mouse aim. Or maybe I thought this was the Doc himself and I wanted to punish him for something. I dunno, but now I just feel awful about it because this is really a fantastic job and I love the DPC Inside Humor type shots. I owe you a beer. Would you accept a ping pong ball?</td>', 'My 10,000th comment: I actually voted on this one - a 4??? WTF was I thinking?? Drinking must''ve affected my mouse aim. Or maybe I thought this was the Doc himself and I wanted to punish him for something. I dunno, but now I just feel awful about it because this is really a fantastic job and I love the DPC Inside Humor type shots. I owe you a beer. Would you accept a ping pong ball?', '2009-01-16 23:09:48.000000', NULL, 0),
