(5494671, 630995, 49773, '<td valign="top">I like this for so many reason. First of all, the composition is so naturally nice, the "gradient" rule of thirds, starting with the blue water on the bottom, gradually fading with the river flow, fading to the white, washed out sky (with blown highlights being the positive thing here). Secondly and more important, the story is wonderful. It has so many endings, actually, it has so many begginings. Thanks for depicting it.</td>', 'I like this for so many reason. First of all, the composition is so naturally nice, the "gradient" rule of thirds, starting with the blue water on the bottom, gradually fading with the river flow, fading to the white, washed out sky (with blown highlights being the positive thing here). Secondly and more important, the story is wonderful. It has so many endings, actually, it has so many begginings. Thanks for depicting it.', '2009-05-20 21:54:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5601290, 632535, 69008, '<td valign="top">The HDR makes for terrific detail in this image. As was mentioned, the clouds must have changed between shots, making the sky look a little odd, but still very dramatic.  It''s a beautiful scene, and a fine image.</td>', 'The HDR makes for terrific detail in this image. As was mentioned, the clouds must have changed between shots, making the sky look a little odd, but still very dramatic.  It''s a beautiful scene, and a fine image.', '2009-08-06 12:23:24.000000', NULL, 0),
